Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:00.46,Short,,0,0,0,,Your cat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:00.96,Short,,0,0,0,,isn't just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:01.74,Short,,0,0,0,,making biscuits
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:02.49,Short,,0,0,0,,on you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.49,0:00:03.06,Short,,0,0,0,,It's doing one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.06,0:00:03.90,Short,,0,0,0,,of the first things
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:04.96,Short,,0,0,0,,it ever learned
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.25,0:00:05.96,Short,,0,0,0,,Newborn kittens
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:07.20,Short,,0,0,0,,knead their mother's belly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:07.98,Short,,0,0,0,,while they nurse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:08.62,Short,,0,0,0,,and the pressing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.62,0:00:09.96,Short,,0,0,0,,helps the milk flow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:10.84,Short,,0,0,0,,Most cats
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:12.34,Short,,0,0,0,,never grow out of it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:12.86,Short,,0,0,0,,When they feel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:14.02,Short,,0,0,0,,safe and warm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:14.62,Short,,0,0,0,,the kitten move
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:15.46,Short,,0,0,0,,comes back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:16.44,Short,,0,0,0,,often with purring
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:18.18,Short,,0,0,0,,and sometimes drool
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.18,0:00:19.18,Short,,0,0,0,,They have scent glands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:20.10,Short,,0,0,0,,between their toes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:21.12,Short,,0,0,0,,so every press
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:21.74,Short,,0,0,0,,leaves a little
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.74,0:00:23.20,Short,,0,0,0,,of their smell on you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:24.47,Short,,0,0,0,,You've been claimed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.47,0:00:25.28,Short,,0,0,0,,And the claws?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:26.84,Short,,0,0,0,,Kittens do that too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:27.52,Short,,0,0,0,,Their mom
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:28.52,Short,,0,0,0,,just had more fur
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:28.96,Short,,0,0,0,,than you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:30.03,Short,,0,0,0,,So if your cat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.03,0:00:30.96,Short,,0,0,0,,climbs on your lap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:31.98,Short,,0,0,0,,and starts kneading
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:32.58,Short,,0,0,0,,hold still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.58,0:00:32.93,Short,,0,0,0,,because
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.47,0:00:31.80,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to someone\Nwhose cat makes biscuits on them
